> Could you please reference #35645 in this PR

[Original comment](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/38164#issuecomment-5583082910)

@imReese The overlapping chunk-budget helper and waiting-loop guard are removed in favor of #35645. The body references that PR and credits your changes and @Kangwenqiao's tests. The remaining changes cover receiver deadlines, stale prefill-only state and pending health signals.

